# V220: ephemeral training-run artifacts. These are produced by background
# determinism/grid runs and must NOT enter the index — a background run writing
# them while a foreground session commits is the index-contention class that
# wedged sessions across V210–V220. The committed per-version results.json /
# trades.csv (referenced by the V###.md log) are added explicitly, not via glob.
data/*_pids.txt
data/*_determinism/
data/*_audit/
data/*_grid.log
data/*_grid_summary.txt
data/*_off_crisis_*
data/*_off_recent_*
data/*_off_trend_*
SESSION_NOTES.md
